<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2062746061"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1696604900"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="flowers"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Hana Hope"/><amll:meta key="album" value="flowers"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:20.199"><div begin="00:14.862" end="03:55.445"><p begin="00:14.862" end="00:19.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">霧雨に包まれてた世界が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被雨雾包围的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ri sa me ni tsu tsu ma re te ta se ka i ga</span></p><p begin="00:20.449" end="00:25.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">冷たい素顔で振り向いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转头露出了冰冷的真面目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu me ta i su ga o de fu ri mu i ta</span></p><p begin="00:26.932" end="00:31.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">あの雲はどこまで旅するんだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那片云彩到底要走向何方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ku mo wa do ko ma de ta bi su ru n da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:32.552" end="00:37.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">何も持たないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两手空空地踏上旅途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo mo ta na i de</span></p><p begin="00:38.492" end="00:43.932" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">いくつの声がぶつかり合って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若干个声音在彼此碰撞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku tsu no ko e ga bu tsu ka ri a 't te</span></p><p begin="00:44.532" end="00:50.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">命の赤い飛沫を降らせた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">溅起赤色的飞沫 洒下生命的红雨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i no chi no a ka i hi ma tsu wo fu ra se ta</span></p><p begin="00:50.881" end="00:56.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">僕らはなぜ手に入れるため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何 我们要为了得到什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa na ze te ni i re ru ta me</span></p><p begin="00:56.561" end="01:05.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">失うことを選び続けてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而不断选择失去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u shi na u ko to wo e ra bi tsu zu ke te ru</span></p><p begin="01:06.055" end="01:08.921" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">花が揺れている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">花枝摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ga yu re te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:09.105" end="01:11.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">風が吹き荒れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风肆虐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga fu ki a re ru</span></p><p begin="01:12.111" end="01:17.737" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">次は何を差し出せば生きられる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下一回 要付出什么才能存活下来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu gi wa na ni wo sa shi da se ba i ki ra re ru</span></p><p begin="01:18.124" end="01:21.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">空高く鳥のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法像鸟儿一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ta ka ku to ri no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:21.831" end="01:24.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">飛べない僕たちは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">翱翔天际的我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to be na i bo ku ta chi wa</span></p><p begin="01:25.567" end="01:32.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">傷を引きずって歩いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是带着伤痛蹒跚前行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu wo hi ki zu 't te a ru i ta</span></p><p begin="01:41.953" end="01:46.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">正しさと正しさがぶつかって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各自信奉的正义产生了冲突</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da shi sa to ta da shi sa ga bu tsu ka 't te</span></p><p begin="01:47.760" end="01:52.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">あらたな翳を呼び起こした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度唤醒了沉寂已久的阴影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra ta na ka ge wo yo bi o ko shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:53.879" end="01:59.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">僕の眼は真実を見たくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的双眼渴望着去见证真相</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no me wa shi n ji tsu wo mi ta ku 't te</span></p><p begin="01:59.449" end="02:04.543" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">灯火を掲げ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为此而举起了灯火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to mo shi bi wo ka ka ge</span></p><p begin="02:05.489" end="02:10.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">凍えるほどに虚ろな夜も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便是冰封而又空虚的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko go e ru ho do ni u tsu ro na yo ru mo</span></p><p begin="02:11.529" end="02:17.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">身を寄せ合えば朝は来るだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要彼此依偎同行 黎明便总会到来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi wo yo se a e ba a sa wa ku ru da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:17.905" end="02:22.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">僕らはなぜ傷つけ合うの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们为何要彼此伤害</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra wa na ze ki zu tsu ke a u no</span></p><p begin="02:23.505" end="02:25.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">いつまで...<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要重复着相同的记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ma de</span></p><p begin="02:26.385" end="02:35.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">同じ記憶 繰り返し歩くの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挣扎行走到何时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o na ji ki o ku ku ri ka e shi a ru ku no</span></p><p begin="02:56.842" end="02:59.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">空の向こう側で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在天空的彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no mu ko u ga wa de</span></p><p begin="02:59.872" end="03:03.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">名も知らぬ誰かが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知名的某人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mo shi ra nu da re ka ga</span></p><p begin="03:03.309" end="03:07.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">想いに胸を焦がしている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中正汹涌澎湃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i ni mu ne wo ko ga shi te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:08.895" end="03:11.898" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">その色を 痛みを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个人的色彩 那个人的痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no i ro wo i ta mi wo</span></p><p begin="03:12.221" end="03:15.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">僕ら知っているはずだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们理应知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ra shi 't te i ru ha zu da</span></p><p begin="03:16.031" end="03:20.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">標(みち)は繋がっている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路标是一致的 道路总会相交</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi wa tsu na ga 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:22.578" end="03:25.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">花が揺れるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同摇曳的花枝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ga yu re ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:25.571" end="03:28.362" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">風が走るように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同疾驰的狂风</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ga ha shi ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:28.602" end="03:34.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">次は何を追いかけて生きてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接下来 要追逐什么来生存下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu gi wa na ni wo o i ka ke te i ki te yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:34.618" end="03:41.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">空高く 鳥の翼のない僕たちは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有像鸟儿一样翱翔天际的翅膀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ta ka ku to ri no tsu ba sa no na i bo ku ta chi wa</span></p><p begin="03:42.118" end="03:44.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">大地に今、立って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们如今 站在大地之上步履坚定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i chi ni i ma ta 't te a ru i ta</span></p><p begin="03:45.225" end="03:55.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">歩いた 信じた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此迈步如此自信</span></p></div></body></tt>